        ELIP: Enhanced Visual-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> Foundation <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> for Image Retrieval
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhan%2C+G">Guanqi Zhan</a>, 
      
